# M-002 — MVP Beta

**Status:** Planned  
**Target gate:** 2026-10-11 (forecast)  
**Increment:** PI-002

## Outcome

A user can inspect, validate, query, explain, and generate bounded Codex context through a coherent local CLI, with determinism/security/performance evidence sufficient for broader dogfooding.

## Acceptance

- WC-0005 through WC-0008 accepted;
- Product Goal user journeys work on representative fixtures;
- agent context is deterministic and context-minimized;
- security/determinism gates pass;
- performance baseline exists and no MVP-blocking regression is accepted.

